Package: kmldonkey
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: A MLNet client for controlling centralized downloads.
 KMLDonkey is a GUI-frontend for MLNet. MLNet is an application running as server process to control downloads and peer-to-peer (P2P) file-sharing centralized at another computer. The MLNet server is not bundled with KMLDonkey! You will be required to download and install MLNet separately either on the device itself or another computer to use this application.
 .
 KMLDonkey allows to view, add, cancel, pause and resume downloads, to perform complex file-searches and to fully control MLNet using the buildin command-console.
 .
 MLNet supports different protocols like Bittorrent, Direct Connect, eDonkey, Fasttrack, FileTp (http and ftp downloads), Gnutella and Gnutella2.
